let __v_474 = pyrt::literals::decode("{\"$tuple\":[{\"$tuple\":[\"paddington\",\"If you liked *Paddington*, try *The Mitchells vs the Machines* or *Matilda*: warm, funny and nothing scary. For a clever, warm film, *Knives Out* or *The Grand Budapest Hotel* are the next step.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"martian\",\"If you liked *The Martian*, try *Apollo 13* (tense and practical), *Arrival* (clever and quiet) or *Gravity* (a tight 90 minutes). All solve problems rather than fight.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"get out\",\"If you liked *Get Out*, *Us* and *Nope* are the closest Jordan Peele follow-ups, and *Sorry to Bother You* is stranger and sharper. All three are unsettling rather than gory.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"john wick\",\"If you liked *John Wick*, try *Atomic Blonde* or *Nobody* for the same close-up action, or *The Raid* if you want the fights turned up. Short on plot, long on choreography.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"interstellar\",\"If you liked *Interstellar*, try *Arrival* for the ideas, *Contact* for the wonder and *Moon* for a small, tense one. All quieter than *Interstellar*.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"knives out\",\"If you liked *Knives Out*, *Glass Onion* is the direct sequel; *The Grand Budapest Hotel* has the same wit, and *Clue* is the silly classic.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"godfather\",\"If you liked *The Godfather*, try *Goodfellas* or *The Departed* for crime with momentum, or *Heat* for the bank job and the shootout.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"mean girls\",\"If you liked *Mean Girls*, try *Clueless*, *Easy A* or *Booksmart*: the same sharp high-school comedy, all easy to like.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"breaking bad\",\"After *Breaking Bad*: *Better Call Saul* first (same world, slower and just as good), then *Ozark* for the same dread, or *Narcos* if you want the real story. *The Wire* is the step up if you have not seen it.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"the bear\",\"After *The Bear*: *Boiling Point* (the film, one unbroken take), *Burnt* for a lighter kitchen, or *The Bear*'s closest cousin *Shameless* (US) for a family that shouts. All short episodes.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"happy valley\",\"After *Happy Valley*: *Sherwood*, *Bodyguard* or *Line of Duty* for British tension, and *Unforgotten* if you want the detective work without the violence. *Scott & Bailey* is the gentler one.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"succession\",\"After *Succession*: *The Thick of It* (same writer, sharper jokes), *Billions* for the money, or *Industry* for the young version. *Veep* if you want the comedy turned up.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"stranger things\",\"After *Stranger Things*: *Dark* (German, twistier), *The OA*, or *Super 8* for the film version. *Paper Girls* is the closest comic-book feel.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"the crown\",\"After *The Crown*: *The Queen* and *The Iron Lady* for the same world in film form, *Victoria* for the earlier reign, or *A Very English Scandal* for the same era and wit.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"line of duty\",\"After *Line of Duty*: *Happy Valley* first, then *Bodyguard*, *Sherwood* or *Vigil*. All British, all tense, none gory.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"peaky blinders\",\"After *Peaky Blinders*: *Boardwalk Empire* (the American version), *Gangs of London* for the violence, or *Taboo* with the same lead actor. *Ripper Street* for the period.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"game of thrones\",\"After *Game of Thrones*: *House of the Dragon* is the direct prequel; *The Last Kingdom* is the better-paced one, and *Rome* is the closest in scheming.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"friends\",\"After *Friends*: *Brooklyn Nine-Nine* for the same comfort, *Parks and Recreation* (start at series 2), or *Schitt's Creek*, which gets funny fast. *How I Met Your Mother* if you want the same shape.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"the office\",\"After *The Office*: the UK original if you have only seen the US one, then *Parks and Recreation*, *Brooklyn Nine-Nine* or *Superstore*. All the same mockumentary warmth.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"derry girls\",\"After *Derry Girls*: *The Young Offenders*, *Moone Boy* or *This Way Up* for the same sharp Irish comedy. *Bad Sisters* if you want a darker one.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"friday night dinner\",\"After *Friday Night Dinner*: *The Inbetweeners* or *Gavin & Stacey* for the same family shouting, and *Plebs* if you want the silly version.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"ted lasso\",\"After *Ted Lasso*: *Schitt's Creek* (the same kindness arriving slowly), *Detectorists* for the gentle British version, or *The Good Place* if you want the jokes and the thinking.\"]},{\"$tuple\":[\"the wire\",\"After *The Wire*: *The Shield* and *Generation Kill* (same creator), *Bosch* for the police work, or *Oz* for the same prison-city sweep.\"]}]}")?;
