let __v_3109 = Value::from("One thing out of the house and one thing at home usually fills it. Out: a walk somewhere you have not been, a Saturday market, or a museum or gallery - most are free and good for an hour or two. Home: something to cook properly, a film, or a jigsaw with the radio on. Rain only moves the walk to a pool or a cinema. Is it just you, or is someone coming with you?");
